        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Aiko, Princess Toshi; Masako, Crown Princess of Japan; Naruhito; Akihito; Michiko\n- Roles: Crown Prince of Japan; Crown Princess of Japan; Emperor of Japan; Empress of Japan; heir apparent\n- Places: Japan\n- Concepts: Chrysanthemum Throne\n\nFacts:\n- Masako, Crown Princess of Japan, was born as Masako Owada on 9 December 1963.\n- Aiko, Princess Toshi, was born on 1 December 2001.\n- Masako, Crown Princess of Japan, is the wife of Naruhito, Crown Prince of Japan.\n- Naruhito is the eldest son of Emperor Akihito and Empress Michiko.\n- Naruhito is the heir apparent to the Chrysanthemum Throne of Japan.\n- Aiko, Princess Toshi, is the only child of Crown Prince Naruhito and Crown Princess Masako of Japan.",
